  "prompt": "Which 3 percent-off promotions (promo_type 'percent_off') had the deepest discount? Return promo_id, promo_name and discount_pct, in that order, with exactly these column names, highest discount_pct first. When promotions tie on discount_pct, the lower promo_id comes first and wins the place. Return exactly 3 rows.",
